  "sticky_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note_rig",
      "text": "**AV Performance Session**\n\nThree tracks cover the full performance:\n- **Drums** — sequencer + four drum synths\n- **Synth** — LFO-swept oscillator tone\n- **Visual** — animated noise texture + bloom\n\nFour scenes map to song sections. Press **V** to open the session strip, then click ▶ on a scene.",
      "x": -20.0, "y": -200.0, "width": 400.0, "height": 150.0, "color": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "note_quantize",
      "text": "**Set quantize to Bar** before launching scenes — each scene fires exactly at the next bar boundary so all tracks stay locked in time.\n\nOr use **Instant** for an immediate cut.",
      "x": 450.0, "y": -200.0, "width": 340.0, "height": 90.0, "color": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "note_synth",
      "text": "**Synth track:** LFO drives Oscillator frequency via a remap wire (0–1 → 55–330 Hz). Clips change the LFO sweep range and the Gain level — giving each section a distinct timbral character.",
      "x": -20.0, "y": 800.0, "width": 380.0, "height": 90.0, "color": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "note_visual",
      "text": "**Visual track:** NoiseTexture → Bloom. Clips change the noise scale (spatial frequency), animation speed, and bloom intensity. Intro is calm; Drop pushes all three to maximum.",
      "x": 430.0, "y": 800.0, "width": 380.0, "height": 90.0, "color": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note_extend",
      "text": "**Make it yours:**\n- Add clips to any track (+ in track header)\n- Add scenes for breaks, outros, or fills\n- Mix and match: launch one track's clip while another plays freely\n- Select nodes in the graph, right-click a track header → **Assign Selected**",
      "x": -20.0, "y": 920.0, "width": 790.0, "height": 90.0, "color": 3
    }
  ],
